WEBVTT

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:05.270
An average score or higher
for the upcoming midterm exams?

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:10.570
Yes. I'd like Ogata and Furuhashi
to get at least that.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.400
O-Okay.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.530
You're not confident?

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.660
If they can't get an average score
on the midterm exams,

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:22.960
it would be a kindness to have them
change their intended field of study.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.620
That's what I think.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:34.840
Understood.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.680
The midterm exams...

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.550
I'll have them make it somehow.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.970
HEADMASTER

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.270
Excuse me.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.320
There's Yuiga.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.480
Did the Headmaster call him in
for another meeting?

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.030
- Yuiga...
- So that was Yuiga?

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.080
He can't see the reality of the situation.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:04.500
To not try to dissuade them
from their intended field of study...

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.920
As their former tutor myself,
I have one word for that.

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:09.590
"Negligence."

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:15.260
If they don't produce results from the midterms,
you should relieve him of his tutoring duties.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.350
SCHOOL LIBRARY

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:55.480
The first midterm exams for third-years
start next week.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:56.190
EPISODE 3:
A GENIUS RESONATES
EMOTIONALLY WITH X

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.110
Let's get an average score or better,
whatever it takes!

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.400
You're fired up, huh, Nariyuki?

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:02.870
Huh?

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:06.490
On the other hand,
Fuminocchi and Rizurin, you seem down.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:08.830
N-No, not at all!

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:13.420
O-Okay, I'm ready for some studying!
Let's see, what should I start with?

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.250
<i>...you should relieve him of his tutoring duties.</i>

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.340
Again, huh?

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.010
It's just the usual.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:27.260
Every time we get an exam, our tutor changes
because they couldn't produce results.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:33.770
I guess the same thing will happen this time
if results aren't produced.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:40.690
So this "have to" isn't like "possession,"
but "need to do something."

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:44.870
U-Um, so it's the same as "must"?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:49.410
That's right. But the meaning changes
in a negative sentence, so be careful.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.370
Um, Yuiga.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:56.590
Tomorrow's Sunday, so will you come over
to my place to supervise my studying?

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.800
THE NEXT MORNING

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:01.260
OGATA UDON

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.640
<i>Sh-She's going to study here?</i>

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:10.930
Are you the teacher
my daughter's been telling me about?

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:15.020
It seems you're helping her out.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.150
<i>Ogata's dad, huh?</i>

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.190
- Oh, well I—
- By the way, Teacher...

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:24.280
I dare you to get any weird ideas
about my ultima-cute Rizu.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.620
I'll knead you into udon dough
faster than you think.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.330
Dad, you're in the way. Please get back to work.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:34.750
Wh-What? I'm just trying to do
what's best for you.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.460
There's no need. It's just creepy.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.880
Sorry I asked you to come here.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:45.130
My dad is bad at calculating checks,
so I can't leave the shop today.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:50.100
Well, there isn't much time
before the midterms, so let's get to it.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:54.310
<i>When she's dressed like that,
it's like seeing her in a new light.</i>

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.350
What is it?

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.150
N-Nothing. Shall we get started?

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.110
Yes.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:17.460
<i>It's right before the exams, so maybe it's natural,
but she's really focused on studying today.</i>

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:22.800
<i>Even my special VIP recommendation aside,
I want to help her get a good score.</i>

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.350
It's dark already.

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:35.980
Well, since you studied hard today, we covered
all of the material that should be on the test.

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:41.690
Yes. This is the first time I've felt so confident
before a Modern Japanese test.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:46.900
See you tomorrow, Ogata.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.330
Wh-What is it?

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:56.410
N-Nothing. How can I put it...

00:05:56.910 --> 00:06:01.500
What... What if I don't do well
on the midterm exams?

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:05.340
That's obvious.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:09.470
We'll review a lot more
and put that towards the next test.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.050
Anything else?

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.760
N-No.

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:18.020
I mean, please don't treat me like a child.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.980
Sorry, I didn't mean to.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.900
MODERN JAPANESE

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:34.830
<i>The first half of the questions
are from the material I studied.</i>

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:38.460
<i>The remainder is pulled from
other random areas.</i>

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:43.090
<i>Yuiga, this isn't going to work.
I won't be able to...</i>

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.130
<i>Liberal arts?</i>

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:49.180
<i>That's ridiculous. Ogata,
you don't have that kind of talent.</i>

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.340
<i>You should stick with science.</i>

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:54.680
<i>Otherwise that talent will go to waste.</i>

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:58.810
<i>See? You bombed the test.
Now, just do as you're told.</i>

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:00.980
<i>All the tutors up until now</i>

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:06.230
<i>told me to give up on the subject
I'm weak in and stick with my strong area.</i>

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.580
<i>But Yuiga is the only one...</i>

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.830
<i>I won't give up!</i>

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.500
The result is...

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.420
71%?

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:27.340
Really?

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.710
Rizurin, that's awesome!

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.300
This is the highest grade
I've ever gotten for a Modern Japanese test.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.850
You worked so hard, Ogata.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.350
Nariyuki's crying!

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:39.890
Idiot! I'm not crying, you idiot!

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:45.310
<i>I won't tell him that I got lucky
with some of the questions for the second half.</i>

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:51.150
Now if Furuhashi can just get through
the math test tomorrow.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:52.780
Leave it to me.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:58.080
We're screwed.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.790
INFIRMARY

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.790
Thirty-eight point five degrees.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.460
That's definitely not good.

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:07.420
Will you be okay, Fumino?

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.210
This'll probably make
tomorrow's test even rougher.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:15.180
Yeah. I'll talk to the teacher and have Fumino
take tomorrow's test later as a makeup.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.800
I can't do that!

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:19.810
Fuminocchi!

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.430
W-Want some udon?

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:28.070
If it's a makeup,
they dock you 20% off the final score.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:33.780
Math is tough enough for me already,
so there's no way I could get an average score.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:39.620
<i>If they don't produce results from the midterms,
you should relieve him of his tutoring duties.</i>

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.500
Yeah, but you...

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.540
In that case...

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.080
you'll just have to get better
by tomorrow, right?

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:52.720
It's okay! With a cold,
you just need to eat something warm,

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.680
get a good night's sleep, and you'll be cured!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:09:01.140
<i>Takemoto, you shouldn't assume that everyone
has the same simple body structure that you do.</i>

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:09.020
<i>Takemoto invited me to nurse Furuhashi with her,
but is it really okay for me to go?</i>

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.820
<i>And Ogata...</i>

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:15.490
<i>She couldn't go because she has to be at
the restaurant, but she gave me too much food.</i>

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.940
<i>Please take all of it.</i>

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:19.740
Um, according to the map,
her house should be around here...

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:26.170
<i>Sh-She lives in a really nice house.</i>

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:30.250
<i>I guess she's rich, huh? How dare she.</i>

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.090
Huh?

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:33.800
<i>Oh, that's right...</i>

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:38.590
<i>Nobody else is home today,
so you can just come in.</i>

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:41.390
<i>My room is on the second floor,
right by the top of the stairs.</i>

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.100
<i>Got it.</i>

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:48.480
<i>I said that easily,
but actually doing this is a tall order.</i>

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.400
E-Excuse me...

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.530
Huge entryway!

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:59.740
<i>Th-The stairs are soft. They don't make a sound.</i>

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:01.700
<i>Here it is.</i>

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.000
- Hey, Furuhashi, how do you feel?
- W-Wait!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.710
Nariyuki, you moron!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.550
What are you doing,
barging into a girl's bedroom?

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:19.550
You pervert!

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.140
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:22.300
Get out of here!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.430
<i>That's right, she's absolutely right!</i>

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:28.140
<i>I should've waited
for a response after knocking.</i>

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.400
<i>I'm really sorry, Furuhashi!</i>

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.020
You can come in now.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.780
Wh-What?

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:42.160
Nothing. I mean, you are a boy, after all.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:46.620
I guess it's only natural for you
to want to see stuff like that.

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:48.080
Stuff like what?

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:53.210
Forget about it! I won't show you!
Dirty-minded Nariyuki!

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.750
What are you talking about?

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.890
Furuhashi, how do you feel?

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.390
I brought you some provisions.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:07.350
Why are you hiding behind a blanket?

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:11.690
Well, I'm wearing p-pajamas.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:14.270
A-And my hair is messy.

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.190
It's embarrassing.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.490
O-Oh, I see!

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:22.990
<i>She looks cute even to a girl like me! Damn it!</i>

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:28.120
Wow, the kitchen's huge! Nothing like mine.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.870
Well...

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:34.080
Since you brought ingredients,
maybe I'll show off a bit!

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:36.550
<i>Hey, are you sure about this?</i>

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:40.300
Okay.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:41.840
Ta-daaa!

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:45.760
Uruka's special egg porridge
and thick ginger and scallion soup!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.390
It'll warm her up!

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:51.390
But how does it taste?

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:54.520
Excuse me? If you're worried,
why don't you sample it?

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.820
Delicious!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.400
What is this? It's fantastic!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.070
You're actually this good at cooking?

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:07.790
If you thought I was lousy at cooking,
sorry to disappoint you!

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:13.000
When you're dressed like that,
you remind me of a newlywed wife.

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:17.130
<i>Darling, where's my welcome home kiss?</i>

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.750
<i>Here it is, honey.</i>

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:21.170
Wh-What are you saying? Jeez!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.060
You're up, Furuhashi?

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.640
How do you feel?

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:37.190
It feels like my fever went down,
thanks to you two.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.270
Thank you.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:44.660
Sorry, Furuhashi. I've been looking at the textbook
you had open on your desk.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:48.700
It looks like you have a good handle
on the material for the test.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.200
You think so?

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:56.130
Just recently, you taught me something, Yuiga.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.460
Numerical formulas
are something thought up by people,

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:04.180
and there are reasons for how it became like that,
so I can relate to them.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:09.390
Hearing that made me feel like
I'm not so hopeless after all.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:18.020
So please continue to be my tutor!

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:23.320
I have a feeling that with you,
my dream may be within my reach.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.320
Same here.

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:30.870
But maybe you should get back to bed.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:34.250
But I'm fine now. Look, I'm back to normal!

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:36.670
No, I didn't mean it like that.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:40.040
More like, I'm trying to look away, but...

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:45.840
Why didn't you say that before, you dummy?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.550
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:50.300
You were in the middle of your story,
so I didn't want to interrupt!

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:54.100
- Okay! I'll leave the room!
- Huh? Fuminocchi, you're awake?

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.230
FUMINO FURUHASHI
MATHEMATICS SCORE: 68 AVERAGE: 64.6

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.230
RIZU OGATA
JAPANESE SCORE: 71 AVERAGE: 68.0

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:01.570
They both actually scored
higher than the average.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.610
Not bad, Yuiga.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.070
And so...

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:11.780
Congratulations on clearing the midterms!

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.950
Cheers!

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:18.960
<i>Afterwards, he got super-infected
and had to stay in bed.</i>

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.920
GIRLS' SWIMMING CLUB

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.390
Are you serious, Uruka?

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:33.100
You still haven't told him how you feel?

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.310
Hey! Lower your voice!

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:37.560
How many years has it been now?

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.770
How pure can you be?

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.650
Geez, it doesn't matter, right?

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:43.940
Shut up already!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:48.320
This is a problem, Kawase.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:50.700
It certainly is, Umihara.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.450
Am I getting more muscular again?

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.370
Hey, Uruka.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.460
After club, we're hanging out.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.210
Come on, Uruka.

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:07.630
Don't be bashful, just come out.

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:09.970
I can't!

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:11.680
I can't! I can't! I can't!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.680
There's no way this looks good on me!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.180
That's not true!

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:17.180
Yes, it is!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.430
I'm taking it off!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.690
Just give up already and come out!

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:34.830
Yeah. That'll do it.
Go attack Yuiga while wearing that.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.200
Attack...

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.080
Excuse me! We'll take this!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:39.870
Wait!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.750
There we go.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.420
I'll hold on to your uniform.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.250
See you!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.510
H-Hold on!

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:07.070
<i>No matter how you look at it,
this outfit is not my style!</i>

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:12.280
<i>If Nariyuki saw me here...</i>

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:14.990
Huh? Takemoto.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.370
What are you up to?

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.330
Huh? Oh, um...

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:23.540
AKAHORI BOOKS

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.540
I-I thought I would buy a reference book, so...

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.590
Then I'll go with you.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:36.890
ENGLISH
COLLEGE ENTRANCE EXAM QUESTIONS

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:38.510
2.0 DUAL

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.720
This one? No, but...

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:40.100
ENGLISH
COLLEGE ENTRANCE EXAM QUESTIONS

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.610
<i>H-How did it end up like this?</i>

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:51.860
<i>This outfit...
I wonder what Nariyuki thinks about it?</i>

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:59.370
<i>I want to be a princess when I grow up!</i>

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:01.540
<i>Huh? What are you talking about?</i>

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.120
<i>That doesn't suit you at all!</i>

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.290
<i>Anyway, let's play tree-tag!</i>

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.630
<i>"It doesn't suit me." "It's not my style."</i>

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:14.970
<i>I wonder when I started giving up
on this kind of thing?</i>

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.850
Takemoto, how about this one?

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:18.890
<i>He's close!</i>

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:23.310
It was hard to choose, but for English words
and idioms, you should start with this.

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:24.730
<i>He's breathing into my ear!</i>

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.940
Mama, a couple!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.070
Cut it out. It's not polite to point!

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.240
<i>A couple...</i>

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:38.200
<i>Right now, do we look like sweethearts?</i>

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.910
<i>Our shoulders are touching.</i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.210
<i>It's warm.</i>

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:51.210
<i>I wish... I wish they would attach,
so we couldn't separate from each other.</i>

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:56.430
<i>Wait, what? That's not the kind of thing
that usually crosses my mind.</i>

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.390
<i>It must be because of this outfit. It has to be.</i>

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:03.220
Hey, are you listening to me, Takemoto?

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:05.310
Is something wrong?

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:09.360
N-No! It's nothing!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.780
<i>Yikes. I need to keep calm.</i>

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:20.070
<i>There's no way Nariyuki and I look like a couple.</i>

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:22.370
This is for couples only!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:26.290
We have prepared many wonderful prizes!

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.330
The line starts here!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.630
Do we have any couples here?

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:33.170
My little sister, Hazuki, has been wanting that!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.170
SHOPPING TOWN
HYPE UP BRIGADE!!
EVENTS HAPPENING NOW

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:36.380
- Only for couples!
- The "Become a Full Pure" set!

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:36.380
FIRST PRIZE:
BECOME A FULL PURE SET
SECOND PRIZE:
GIFT CERTIFICATES

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.930
<i>"For Couples only".</i>

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:44.560
<i>Maybe he can buy it cheap
if we go in as a couple?</i>

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.600
Let's go, Nariyuki!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.610
L-Look, we're a guy and a girl, after all.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:54.190
Maybe we can get something good
if we claim to be a couple!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:58.530
But are you okay with it?
Pretending we're together like that...

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.200
O-Of course!

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:05.120
I don't mind these kinds of things at all.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.710
Sorry, but thank you!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.170
All right! Hang in there!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:13.290
FOR COUPLES ONLY
PRINCESS CARRY
TOURNAMENT

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:13.290
- Keep it up!
- You're doing great!

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:22.470
Okay, this year's couples only
Princess Carry Tournament has begun!

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:30.390
The last couple standing, who have the deepest love
for each other, will receive a fabulous gift!

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:33.110
<i>What is this tournament?</i>

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.900
<i>He's so close! I'm so happy!
And so embarrassed!</i>

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:37.990
<i>But more than anything,</i>

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:44.580
<i>I've become more muscular recently,
so if he thinks "This muscle woman is heavy!"</i>

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:47.750
Whoa! They're dropping out, one by one!

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.750
Which couple will be the last couple standing?

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:54.000
<i>If Nariyuki thought I was heavy,</i>

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:57.510
<i>I wouldn't be able to live with myself!</i>

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.720
<i>My arms are about to fall off!</i>

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.760
<i>I'm sorry, Hazuki!</i>

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:06.060
<i>Forgive your worthless big brother...</i>

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.850
<i>Takemoto, you're...</i>

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:18.530
<i>You're so embarrassed that you're crying,
but you're hanging in there?</i>

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:23.200
<i>Then I can't lose this battle, even if it kills me!</i>

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:33.460
<i>- And what'll I do if he thinks I smell sweaty?
- I swear I'll win, Takemoto!</i>

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:40.010
I'm sorry, Takemoto.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:42.050
For what?

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:48.260
Well, um, you were so embarrassed by that
"princess carry" that you were crying, right?

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.980
Maybe the shock from before
made me numb to that kind of thing.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:03.490
Hey, Nariyuki.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:08.410
I look like a princess today, don't I?

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:15.250
I-I wonder if this outfit looks good on me.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:18.210
It—

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.550
What was that for, Takemoto?

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:23.510
Never mind!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:28.600
It's okay, Nariyuki,
it doesn't matter what you think!

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:30.310
See you!

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:12.620
Yay!

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:15.950
Thanks, Brother!

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:21.000
That was the prize
for the Princess Carry Tournament, wasn't it?

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:22.420
Yeah.

00:23:23.590 --> 00:23:26.380
Who did you participate with, as a "couple"?

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:29.130
I'd like to hear all the details!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.810
NEXT EPISODE:
WHAT SHE WANTS
FROM A GENIUS IS X

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:39.810
Next time: What She Wants from a Genius Is X.
